OL,3,ABayeux Tapestry exhibit opens doors for
OL,4,Afirst time as visitors flock to the
OL,5,ABritish Museum
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Bayeux Tapestry was originally
OL,8,Fembroidered in England and tells the
OL,9,Fstory of the Norman conquest of England
OL,10,Fand the Battle of Hastings in 1066
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
